1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,350
Freelancers lose time chasing agreements and payments.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,920
And when clients ask for extra work, it often goes unpaid.

3
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:16,000
FreelanceFlow AI keeps it all connected, from the first conversation to the final payment.

4
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,800
Here is a real client message.

5
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:26,140
A landing page, a fifteen hundred dollar budget, and thirty percent upfront.

6
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:30,640
With one click, AI turns it into a structured project.

7
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:37,480
Deliverables, a timeline, and two milestones: a four hundred fifty dollar deposit,

8
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:41,320
and a one thousand fifty dollar final payment.

9
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:46,570
Nothing is agreed until the freelancer reviews it and confirms.

10
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:54,390
AI drafts the proposal wording, while the prices come straight from the milestones.

11
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,510
Sending it locks the terms.

12
00:00:56,560 --> 00:01:01,620
The client opens a private link, and approves that exact version.

13
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:06,140
Now the freelancer requests the deposit.

14
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:10,650
The client pays with PayPal, here in the PayPal Sandbox.

15
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:16,850
FreelanceFlow confirms the payment with PayPal before marking it as received.

16
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:20,160
The receipt shows the PayPal capture ID,

17
00:01:20,210 --> 00:01:25,150
and the project now shows four hundred fifty dollars received.

18
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:31,040
Later, the client asks: can you also add a booking system?

19
00:01:31,090 --> 00:01:36,030
FreelanceFlow compares the request with the approved agreement.

20
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:42,130
It points to the exact terms it relied on, and explains why this is new work.

21
00:01:42,180 --> 00:01:46,480
The freelancer sets the price at three hundred dollars.

22
00:01:47,830 --> 00:01:50,090
The client approves the change.

23
00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:56,360
The project is now worth eighteen hundred dollars, with four hundred fifty received,

24
00:01:56,410 --> 00:01:59,280
and thirteen hundred fifty outstanding.

25
00:01:59,330 --> 00:02:04,500
The timeline and the financial dashboard update from the same records.

26
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:11,930
With FreelanceFlow AI, freelancers spend less time on admin, protect their scope,

27
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:14,050
and get paid through PayPal.

28
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:19,880
From the first conversation to the final payment, everything stays connected.

